{
  "id": 444448584,
  "iid": 23110,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Sharkd: Bugfix remove forced synchronous DNS resolution",
  "description": "sharkd was incorrectly forcing sync DNS lookups, blocking on every\nresolution and making name resolution extremely slow. Removed this to use\nasync resolution like Wireshark GUI does - names resolve in the\nbackground and appear on subsequent requests instead of blocking the\nsession.\n\nThis bug should be fixed in the current release branch as it makes\nsharkd unusable with `nameres.use_external_name_resolver` enabled.",
