        "fd3d0d15aa5746f6aef2f22bcc7916f026d19ec5"
      ],
      "title": "Sharkd: Bugfix to remove forced synchronous DNS resolution",
      "message": "Sharkd: Bugfix to remove forced synchronous DNS resolution\n\nsharkd was incorrectly forcing sync DNS lookups, blocking on every\nresolution and making name resolution extremely slow. Removed this to use\nasync resolution like Wireshark GUI does - names resolve in the\nbackground and appear on subsequent requests instead of blocking the\nsession.\n\nThis bug should be fixed in the current release branch as it makes\nsharkd unusable with `nameres.use_external_name_resolver` enabled.\n",
      "author_name": "Zach Chadwick",
      "author_email": "zachad@qacafe.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-01-06T15:22:15.000-05:00",
